mbitions/a-79523557?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bosnia and Herzegovina is governed by a system established after the Bosnian war — more than 30 years ago. Ethnic divisions, a complex administration and European integration all shape the country's political reality.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>German reunification: How inequality is shaping a new East German identity</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c3b6e32de8110ad42ba4699fc4e6983cd002f886d8624652f3a573dbebec18e4</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T04:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-reunification-how-inequality-is-shaping-a-new-east-german-identity/a-79518541--28106a765624.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-reunification-how-inequality-is-shaping-a-new-east-german-identity/a-79518541?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A new study highlights persistent structural disparities in wealth and leadership positions between East and West Germany, 36 years after reunification.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Spain's parliament rejects housing bill as protests continue</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7fe5e9839c2b87c9cb5d044f5c00dc1ca69214bb5a5ef5f25b445457cff6b2d2</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T16:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spain-s-parliament-rejects-housing-bill-as-protests-continue/a-79522683--f3b2b2f36991.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-s-parliament-rejects-housing-bill-as-protests-continue/a-79522683?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Spain's minority government suffered defeat in parliament as it tried to push through a pair of emergency measures aimed at making housing more affordable. A pensioner's eviction and protests led to the bid.</summary><category term="New