urb irregular migration</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:979a86120410b58f248ccbf3c22dea8e252cf5cd9cea1ffbaf8166533c7cca31</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T00:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-ministers-mull-new-ways-to-curb-irregular-migration/a-79509375--720c002ac8dc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-ministers-mull-new-ways-to-curb-irregular-migration/a-79509375?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The proposals include setting up so-called return hubs outside the EU and strengthening the border agency Frontex. Greece has even proposed temporarily suspending asylum applications in emergency situations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Klopp wins first game as Germany coach, without 'top dogs'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9c0a4939879bf49e0f07ddcf0cb9f30b4fce128e97cb7336b9a97027d56d037c</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T22:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/klopp-wins-first-game-as-germany-coach-without-top-dogs/a-79508898--6c1fca750e8a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/klopp-wins-first-game-as-germany-coach-without-top-dogs/a-79508898?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">It may have taken a little longer than he would have liked, but Jürgen Klopp has finally won a game as Germany coach. Despite a number of debutants, it was a familiar face who stood out in the victory over Serbia.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Latvians head to the polls with Russia on their minds</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2d248e388c9db5174e9fb5756b7e82daa5aabca9ea9678c7fae674ea2faab2e2</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T17:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/on-october-3-latvians-will-elect-a-new-parliament-_-with-russia-looming-lar